    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "我叫西西。我是猫，我一岁了。",
      "traditional": "我叫西西。我是貓，我一歲了。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ jiào xī xī wǒ shì māo wǒ yí suì le",
      "english": "My name is Xixi. I am a cat. I am one year old."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "我们家有三口人，爸爸、妈妈和我。",
      "traditional": "我們家有三口人，爸爸、媽媽和我。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ men jiā yǒu sān kǒu rén bà ba mā ma hé wǒ",
      "english": "There are three people in our family: Dad, Mom, and me."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "我的妈妈叫高小月。她是中国人，今年二十三岁。",
      "traditional": "我的媽媽叫高小月。她是中國人，今年二十三歲。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ de mā ma jiào gāo xiǎo yuè tā shì zhōng guó rén jīn nián èr shí sān suì",
      "english": "My mom is called Gao Xiaoyue. She is Chinese. She is 23 years old this year."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "她的家在北京，但是我们现在住在日本。",
      "traditional": "她的家在北京，但是我們現在住在日本。",
      "pinyin": "tā de jiā zài běi jīng dàn shì wǒ men xiàn zài zhù zài rì běn",
      "english": "Her home is in Beijing, but we currently live in Japan."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "我的妈妈在日本的大学读书，她是一名大学生。",
      "traditional": "我的媽媽在日本的大學讀書，她是一名大學生。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ de mā ma zài rì běn de dà xué dú shū tā shì yì míng dà xué shēng",
      "english": "My mom is studying at a university in Japan. She is a university student."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "我的爸爸叫大北。他是瑞典人，今年二十五岁。他住在瑞典。",
      "traditional": "我的爸爸叫大北。他是瑞典人，今年二十五歲。他住在瑞典。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ de bà ba jiào dà běi tā shì ruì diǎn rén jīn nián èr shí wǔ suì tā zhù zài ruì diǎn",
      "english": "My dad is called Dabei. He is Swedish. He is 25 years old this year. He lives in Sweden."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "他也是一名大学生，他在学习日语。",
      "traditional": "他也是一名大學生，他在學習日語。",
      "pinyin": "tā yě shì yì míng dà xué shēng tā zài xué xí rì yǔ",
      "english": "He is also a university student. He is studying Japanese."
