      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "瑞典在哪里？我不知道。我看见我的爸爸在电脑里面。",
      "traditional": "瑞典在哪裏？我不知道。我看見我的爸爸在電腦裡面。",
      "pinyin": "ruì diǎn zài nǎ lǐ wǒ bù zhī dào wǒ kàn jiàn wǒ de bà ba zài diàn nǎo lǐ miàn",
      "english": "Where is Sweden? I don’t know. I see my dad is inside the computer."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "每天早上七点半，妈妈要打电话。妈妈打电话的时候，爸爸在电脑里面。",
      "traditional": "每天早上七點半，媽媽要打電話。媽媽打電話的時候，爸爸在電腦裡面。",
      "pinyin": "měi tiān zǎo shang qī diǎn bàn mā ma yào dǎ diàn huà mā ma dǎ diàn huà de shí hou bà ba zài diàn nǎo lǐ miàn",
      "english": "Every morning at 7:30, Mom will make a phone call. When Mom makes a phone call, Dad is inside the computer."
    },
    {
